                "text": "I\u00a0had\u00a0hoped we wouldn\u2019t\u00a0get here. This is officially the longest government shutdown in U.S. history. This isn\u2019t\u00a0a record worth celebrating and it was completely avoidable had Congressional Republicans been willing to negotiate a solution to prevent\u00a0health care premiums\u00a0from skyrocketing.",
