                "text": "Health care premiums are skyrocketing because Congressional Republicans refuse to extend tax credits that lower the cost of Affordable Care Act health insurance plans. The average premium will jump from $888 to $1,904. It\u2019s\u00a0unacceptable. https://t.co/CHn4mbfeVJ",
