                "text": "Millions of Americans covered by the Affordable Care Act are going to see their premiums increase if Congressional Republicans don\u2019t get back to work. We cannot allow Americans to pay DOUBLE for their health insurance when costs are already way too high. https://t.co/qXr8ijHW3t",
