                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "America is already far too expensive for working families. I will not vote for a funding bill that leaves millions facing higher premiums and less certainty about their coverage. I will oppose any bill that pretends the health care crisis can be handled later, when we all know there is no commitment and no guarantee that the House will ever get that vote.",
