                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Families are facing higher health care premiums and Mike Johnson won\u2019t even\u00a0promise a vote on the issue\u2014let alone\u00a0promise to work with us and fix it. Millions will be priced out of their health insurance if Congress doesn\u2019t\u00a0act fast.",
