                "retweet_count": 52,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019m hearing stories every day from my constituents who are facing healthcare premiums rising so high that they may not be able to afford any health care at all.\n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting to extend the ACA tax credits to lower healthcare costs for the American people. https://t.co/cxkG4ox4Tf",
