                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 621,
                "retweet_count": 33,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans still have no alternative plan with Affordable Care Act credits expiring in 29 DAYS. Premiums are about to skyrocket, yet they\u2019re offering nothing of substance. Mike Johnson doesn\u2019t even have \u201cconcepts of a plan.\u201d It\u2019s time for House Republicans to work with us, sign our discharge petition to extend these credits for three years, and end the uncertainty of exploding healthcare premiums for millions of Americans.",
