                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump and Vance keep insisting the economy is at an \u201cA+++\u201d. \n\nThey should try telling that to Americans opening electric bills they can barely afford. To parents watching grocery prices climb week after week. To families losing their health care coverage because it\u2019s become too expensive \u2014 and to hardworking people losing their jobs as unemployment reaches a four-year high. \n\nTrump and Vance can hand themselves fake grades all they want. This economy works for Trump, Vance, and their billionaire buddies \u2014 but it\u2019s failing everyone else.",
